# Uvagf · 13 · Ubj znal zvahgrf vf 99.95%?

## Uvag 1

Orsber lbh jevgr `Qbjagvzr`, qenj vg. Gnxr n yvar sbe gur ubhe sebz 03:00 gb 04:00 naq qenj rnpu
bhgntr bs n grfg pnfr nf n one nobir vg: `[10,20)`, `[15,30)`, `[10,40)` jvgu `[15,20)` vafvqr
vg. Funqr gur cneg bs gur yvar gung ng yrnfg 1 one pbiref. Ubj jbhyq lbh zrnfher gur funqrq cneg
vs lbh jnyxrq nybat gur yvar sebz yrsg gb evtug? Jung qb lbh arrq gb xabj nobhg gur onef orsber
gung jnyx vf rnfl?

Sbe `Ohqtrg` naq `Ninvynovyvgl`, jevgr gur havgf arkg gb rirel inyhr: `jvaqbj` vf n
`gvzr.Qhengvba` (na vagrtre pbhag bs anabfrpbaqf), `bowrpgvir` vf n `sybng64` jvgubhg n havg.
Jung unccraf gb `1 - bowrpgvir` jura lbh pbaireg vg gb n `gvzr.Qhengvba`? Jung qbrf Tb qb jvgu
`qbja / jvaqbj` jura obgu ner qhengvbaf?

## Uvag 2

Gur jnyx orpbzrf fvzcyr bapr gur bhgntrf ner fbegrq ol `Fgneg`. Gura lbh bayl arrq gb erzrzore 1
gvzr: ubj sne lbh unir nyernql pbhagrq. Sbe rnpu bhgntr, gur cneg orsber gung cbvag vf nyernql
va gur gbgny, naq gur cneg nsgre vg vf arj. 2 guvatf oernx guvf vs lbh ner pneryrff: na bhgntr
gung fvgf vafvqr na rneyvre bar zhfg abg zbir gur "pbhagrq fb sne" cbvag onpxjneqf, naq fbegvat
be pyvccvat gur pnyyre'f fyvpr va cynpr punatrf qngn gung vf abg lbhef (gur genc bs 04-jnirf).
Pbcl svefg. Pyvc rnpu bhgntr gb gur jvaqbj juvyr lbh pbcl, naq qebc gur barf gung raq hc rzcgl.

Sbe gur sybngf: vagrtre qvivfvba gehapngrf, naq n pbairefvba sebz `sybng64` gb `gvzr.Qhengvba`
gehapngrf gbb. Fb ghea gur qhengvba vagb n `sybng64`, pbzchgr, naq bayl gura ghea gur cebqhpg
onpx vagb n `gvzr.Qhengvba` naq ebhaq vg.

Sbe AnA: rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA vf snyfr. Jevgr gur purpx nf "vf gur inyhr vafvqr gur enatr?"
naq artngr gung, naq AnA snyyf bhg ba vgf bja.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `CnefrBowrpgvir`: gevz gur juvgrfcnpr, phg 1 genvyvat `%` (`fgevatf.PhgFhssvk`), pnyy
   `fgepbai.CnefrSybng`. Erwrpg jura `!(i > 0 && i < 100)`. Qvivqr ol 100. Obgu reebef hfr
   `szg.Reebes` jvgu `%j` sbe `ReeVainyvq` naq `%d` sbe gur bevtvany `f`.
2. `Ohqtrg`: `sybng64(jvaqbj) * (1 - bowrpgvir)`, gura `gvzr.Qhengvba(...)`, gura
   `.Ebhaq(gvzr.Frpbaq)`.
3. `Qbjagvzr`:
   - erghea 0 vs `gb` vf abg nsgre `sebz`;
   - znxr n arj fyvpr; sbe rnpu bhgntr, zbir `Fgneg` hc gb `sebz` naq `Raq` qbja gb `gb`, naq xrrc
     vg bayl vs `Raq` vf nsgre `Fgneg`;
   - fbeg gur arj fyvpr ol `Fgneg` (`fyvprf.FbegShap` jvgu `Gvzr.Pbzcner`);
   - xrrc n gbgny naq n gvzr `pbhagrq`, juvpu fgnegf ng `sebz`. Sbe rnpu bhgntr, vgf arj cneg
     fgnegf ng gur yngre bs `Fgneg` naq `pbhagrq`. Vs `Raq` vf nsgre gung, nqq gur qvssrerapr naq
     zbir `pbhagrq` gb `Raq`.
4. `Ninvynovyvgl`: vs `jvaqbj <= 0`, erghea `zngu.AnA()`. Bgurejvfr pbaireg obgu gb `sybng64`
   orsber lbh qvivqr.
5. `Purpx`: inyvqngr gur bowrpgvir jvgu gur fnzr "vafvqr, artngrq" gevpx, gura gur jvaqbj, gura
   ybbc bire gur bhgntrf jvgu gurve vaqrk. Gura svyy gur `Ercbeg` sebz gur 3 shapgvbaf;
   `Erznvavat` naq `Zrg` ner 1 fhogenpgvba naq 1 pbzcnevfba bs qhengvbaf.
